{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6jYKOv1LYdIXbmnUWte_dg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:34.813097+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6jYKOv1LYdIXbmnUWte_dg","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAMr8a2x0tSmcef7iaHbXEnDMyBX3MXicWxzuQIg7Y8D2khxYtiaB6miajiaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAeJawrz92R1wPfhPAmHS9eriak6qjpfNhb5BxpiagmBgU1r9r01cG7dGQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAeEKcJz5MPQcDF3HEqfxNtiaAIg7MmNiaQrAgnqvtkQ9LDoKXibZQl0Lsg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnA1SMqYtIyeaz1tiapsVbK5XYpt1Pxtua1H52v49hJSzOBrOgVycb6mgg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>南方科技大学机械与能源工程系拟于2025年7月举办“2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营”。夏令营旨在为了增进国内机械相关学科优秀大学生之间的学术交流，提前选拔2026级推免硕士研究生和直博研究生。南科大将为录取的优秀学子提供丰厚的奖助学金和一流的科研条件，欢迎全国优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>招生专业</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.  0801Z1 智能制造与机器人（学硕、学博）</span></p><p><span>2.  080500 材料科学与工程（学硕、学博）</span></p><p><span>3.  081100 控制科学与工程（学硕、学博）</span></p><p><span>4.  085500 机械（专硕、专博）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>（*最终以研招网系统公布为准）</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>招生导师及研究方向</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>招生导师及研究方向见系官网：https://mee.sustech.edu.cn/quanzhijiaoshi/。点击文末“阅读原文”跳转至系官网。</span><strong><span>（建议学生提前联系意向导师）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 全国高校本科在校生（预计2026年毕业），本科专业要求机械、电子、材料、能源、力学、物理等学科方向，对机器人技术、智能制造、成形制造及3D打印、精密超精密加工、软物质设计与制造、激光微纳制造、新能源工程等研究方向及其前沿交叉领域有浓厚的研究兴趣；</span></p><p><span>2. 前三学年本科总评成绩专业排名前30%，已获得或将获得所读大学免试推荐研究生资格；</span></p><p><span>3. 对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和良好的英语水平；</span></p><p><span>4. 身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动安排</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 活动时间：预计2025年7月初。</span></p><p><span>2. 活动安排（拟定）：开营仪式、师生交流、论坛报告、推免生面试（如需线上面试将提前通知）、实验室参观、校园全景游览等。</span></p><p><span>3. 活动费用：南科大机械系将为异地学校营员提供夏令营期间在深圳的免费食宿，并给予部分路费补贴。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿，仅提供免费用餐。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span> *活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；营员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式及提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.网上申报时间：</span><span><strong><span>2025年4月22日上午9：00至6月16日晚上23：00</span></strong></span><span>，登录南方科技大学研究生招生服务系统（https://yzbm. sustech.edu.cn/，推荐使用 chrome、360 浏览器），点击“全国优秀大学生夏令营”进行在线报名。申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按照要求提供本人各项真实信息。需填报不超过3个意向报考导师并上传以下证明材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；成绩单上所标注所在专业的成绩排名；</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述（介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内）；</span></p><p><span>（5）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></p><p><span>（6）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.申请截止日期：请于</span><strong><span><span>2025年6月16日23：00</span></span></strong><span>前，按要求在研究生招生服务系统提交相关申请材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>提醒：入营报到时请携带有效的本人身份证和学生证进行资格审查，并按顺序提交身份证复印件（等比例双面复印）、学生证复印件，所有文件原件请一并携带备查，其他证明材料可提供复印件。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>材料审核及入选通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请截止后，夏令营审核工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将于</span><span><strong><span>6月25日</span></strong></span><span>前以电子邮件形式通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>有关夏令营活动咨询，请优先以</span><strong><span>“夏令营咨询”</span></strong><span>为邮件主题发送给：</span></span><span><span>meeyzb@sustech.edu.cn或致电 0755-88018143（邓老师）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>南科大机械系研招群：</span><strong><span>586517418</span></strong><span>（</span><strong><span>备注夏令营+姓名+学校</span></strong><span>）。更多信息请关注南方科技大学机械与能源工程系网站：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>https://mee.sustech.edu.cn/</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>南科大机能系简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAql1KGyL6CNibTCnwfVpYP4ERtfqbEC8gR5ibWGiciaRAgVOfFs03hOMEKw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>南方科技大学机械与能源工程系建立于2016年1月，以建设国际一流的创新工程人才培养和科学研究基地为目的。建系以来，大力引进海内外高层次人才，已初步建成一支优秀的教学与科研团队，现有教研序列教授37人，其中包括：4名全职院士、22名国家高层次人才入选者（含青年）。本学科研究生导师全部具有博士学位，教研系列教授 94% 以上人才有海外教育及工作经历，63% 以上来自于哈佛大学、麻省理工大学、斯坦福大学、剑桥大学、英国伦敦国王学院、瑞士苏黎世联邦理工学院、日本东京大学、香港大学等世界大学排名前 50 的知名高校。</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>先进的科研平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAHWu7N81TkmgG16dmsmdspg5ab4qrGV9xPuRxuw0pibR9UIk1BuwibiaXw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>成立9年以来，机械与能源工程系已获批建设2个广东省高校重点实验室、4个市级重点实验室、1个深圳市工程实验室、2个深圳市工程研究中心、2个广创团队、4个孔雀团队，成立了以赵天寿院士牵头的南科大碳中和能源研究院、以戴建生院士牵头的南科大机器人研究院。现已建成近40个科研实验室，签订24个校企联合实验室，与华为、腾讯、富士康等知名企业进行科研合作。未来将建设成为兼具创新人才培养模式、前沿交叉、国际化的一流科研平台。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>前沿的研究方向</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAyjUSiaYq5MAu1J1A2okZDQUpFedRNfAwTgeJUicRNbtXS7vpsOYOjU7A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAQ4jqF1aAvzYmJuuQ4bXpIpfcKUlvoaNYr8FArgibjEYxJXXNg1qzwyg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAcPqVuVt1uXlZOGw9UlZYL6XwibRK72FhkTAKwibc7UprpjL40RdtxAiaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAEjrhc22GzSuia0SZw1aljPSfUS5RmnzkBp3D9rbeunSlbgIQAnxEM1w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>本系的科学研究及学生培养以机器人技术、先进制造、新能源科学与技术为核心，发展机器人技术、智能制造、成形制造及3D&amp;4D打印、精密超精密加工、软物质设计与制造、激光微纳制造、新能源工程等前沿交叉学科。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>创新型培育模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAsABVszOibH9YEC12nX1QbNPQeo5DT0KVXQQbiaxEn0guFZaiaVibytFxRw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>本系现已招收9届硕士、博士研究生。在卓越师资的引领下，同学们潜心科研，参加国内外前沿会议，独立或组团承担创新实践项目，取得多项优质成果。南科大给予学生丰厚的奖助学金、先进的科研设备及平台、良好的英文学习环境，助力学生成为具有坚实理论基础、杰出实践能力、自主学习能力的创新拔尖人才。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>多元化成果输出</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnARJRHxUkXlGac9W047p4xPKSbvjHvtibE3Y1O7ynz36tFETKjDGwEsmA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>近年来，本系研究生斩获“挑战杯”国家级银奖3项、铜奖2项、省级金奖4项，获水下机器人、软体机器人、机器人及人工智能等国内国际级竞赛奖励80余项。研究生以一作发表SCI高水平论文400余篇，其中在Science Advances、Nature Communications、International Journal of Machine Tools and Manufacturing、Advanced Materials等顶级期刊上发表研究论文20余篇，受邀参加国内外会议报告研究成果逾300人次。本系已有7届硕士毕业生、5届博士毕业生，合计逾300人。硕士升学读博率约为25%，就职于华为、大疆、比亚迪、鹏芯微等龙头企业的毕业生约15%。前景无限广阔！</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>盛夏赴南科之约，共绘学术星河</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>机能系夏令营等你启航~</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>机械与能源工程系</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑| 李新月</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BBRInaxk4sRdp7iaK3bexbrj1icV47YLnAQRvkDq09ZZOorpNB4seSxtG1xLOq0BWMVJqrHrGGpkVCicWauFNnB3w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ea9d3689167d3d89b47015b6a64ea8681d160bd81a6da4f9aaeb9a830740bd41","textLength":2643,"sourceSha256":"15a0ea8b33d64fe89332aeffac8829834f656ef525a854f271caf7c1370e48be","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ab7cef2fa414491b56ae","title":"2025年南方科技大学机械与能源工程系2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:34.813097+00:00"}
